      "title": "MKVentures Capital Limited Announces Board Changes",
      "body": "MKVentures Capital Limited, based on the recommendation of the Nomination & Remuneration Committee, approved the appointment of Mr. Sanket Rathi as the Chief Compliance Officer (CCO) of the Company for a period of five (5) years, with immediate effect, in accordance with the applicable RBI Guidelines. Consequent to the above, his designation shall stand revised to Company Secretary & Chief Compliance Officer. The Board, on the recommendation of the Nomination & Remuneration Committee, approved the proposal for appointment of Mr. Ajay Shah as an Additional Director of the Company, subject to regulatory approvals and statutory compliances. The Board approved the proposal for re-designation of Mr. Madhusudan Kela from Managing Director to Non-Executive, Non-Independent Chairman of the Company",
